<view class="screen tv-download-screen {{themeClass}}" style="{{themeStyle}}">
  <view class="screen-header">
    <view class="screen-title">电视版 APK</view>
    <view class="screen-kicker">TV APP</view>
  </view>

  <view class="apk-status-row">
    <view class="apk-status-icon">
      <image class="apk-status-symbol" src="/assets/icons/tv-action.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    </view>
    <view class="apk-status-copy">
      <view class="apk-status-title">唱片柜电视版</view>
      <view class="apk-status-meta">{{fileName}} · {{fileSize}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="apk-status-badge">APK</view>
  </view>

  <view class="guide-section">
    <view class="section-title">安装指引</view>
    <view class="guide-list">
      <view class="guide-step">
        <view class="guide-step-index">1</view>
        <view class="guide-step-copy">
          <view class="guide-step-title">下载并分享</view>
          <view class="guide-step-desc">点击下方按钮，下载完成后把安装包分享给微信好友或文件传输助手。</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="guide-step">
        <view class="guide-step-index">2</view>
        <view class="guide-step-copy">
          <view class="guide-step-title">保存到电脑桌面</view>
          <view class="guide-step-desc">在电脑微信中下载文件，确认文件属性是 APK，文件名必须以 .apk 结尾，不能是 .apk(1)。</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="guide-step">
        <view class="guide-step-index">3</view>
        <view class="guide-step-copy">
          <view class="guide-step-title">整理到独立文件夹</view>
          <view class="guide-step-desc">在桌面新建文件夹，把 APK 文件放入文件夹，再将整个文件夹复制到 U 盘，不容易安装出错。</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="guide-step">
        <view class="guide-step-index">4</view>
        <view class="guide-step-copy">
          <view class="guide-step-title">通过 U 盘安装</view>
          <view class="guide-step-desc">把 U 盘插入电视，打开文件管理器找到安装包，按电视提示允许安装未知来源应用并完成安装。</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="guide-step">
        <view class="guide-step-index">5</view>
        <view class="guide-step-copy">
          <view class="guide-step-title">扫码同步收藏</view>
          <view class="guide-step-desc">打开电视端“唱片柜”，显示登录二维码后，用小程序“我的”页面扫码绑定电视，即可同步当前收藏。</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="download-section">
    <view class="section-title">下载 APK</view>
    <view class="download-panel">
      <view class="download-panel-kicker">LATEST</view>
      <view class="download-panel-title">唱片柜电视版安装包</view>
      <view class="download-panel-meta">下载后将直接打开微信文件分享，不会加入小程序包体。</view>
      <button
        class="primary-button download-button"
        loading="{{downloading}}"
        disabled="{{downloading}}"
        bindtap="handleDownloadShare"
        hover-class="button-hover"
      >{{downloading ? (downloadProgress ? '下载 ' + downloadProgress + '%' : '准备下载') : '下载并分享 APK'}}</button>
    </view>
    <view class="download-note">请只安装本页提供的最新版文件。电视安装完成后，APK 可继续保存在 U 盘中备用。</view>
  </view>
</view>
